  "extensions": {
    "legacy": {
      "chapter": 14,
      "location": "隊伍發現一支獸人軍正在休息,趁夜色接近後突襲。逼問俘虜後得知,獸人首領薩卡下令攻打精靈族都城哈斯米爾是為了寶物,而薩卡本人則率另一隊前往拉卡湖攻打豹人族。眾人決議先趕往拉卡湖救援。",
      "source_dat": "FDTXT_014",
      "title": "第十四章 — 夜襲獸人軍,審問薩卡部下"
    }
  },
  "kind": "story",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "夜襲獸人軍,審問俘虜"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 12,
              "speaker_name": "凱麗"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/f95eacdc314e/scenes/0/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-12",
          "text": "看到了!那裡有一大群獸人,好像還在休息呢!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/f95eacdc314e/scenes/0/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "好極了,我們去叫醒牠們!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 3,
              "speaker_name": "哈瓦特"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/f95eacdc314e/scenes/0/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-3",
          "text": "別太猴急,小子!我們先小心接近,再伺機而動!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/f95eacdc314e/scenes/0/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "好,我們上吧!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "獸人"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/f95eacdc314e/scenes/0/lines/4",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/f95eacdc314e/scenes/0/lines/4",
          "text": "吼嗚!注意,有人接近了!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 16,
              "speaker_name": "凱拉斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/f95eacdc314e/scenes/0/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-16",
          "text": "通通給我醒來!開打了!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 17,
              "speaker_name": "米亞斯多德"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/f95eacdc314e/scenes/0/lines/6",
          "speaker": "character/native-17",
          "text": "咦?對手呢?怎麼都是一堆小鬼頭.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 18,
              "speaker_name": "蜜蒂"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/f95eacdc314e/scenes/0/lines/7",
          "speaker": "character/native-18",
          "text": "管他的,知道我們大軍在此集結而還敢接近的,一定不是一般的小鬼,先打了再說!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/f95eacdc314e/scenes/0/lines/8",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "你們來這裡幹什麼?想要命的話就趕快說!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "惡"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/f95eacdc314e/scenes/0/lines/9",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/f95eacdc314e/scenes/0/lines/9",
          "text": "..我..我不知道啊,首領薩卡大人..四天前命令我們在此集結,準備..準備攻打精靈族的都城哈斯米爾,有一隊伙伴已經先去了,到現在還沒回來,結果..結果你們就先來了.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/f95eacdc314e/scenes/0/lines/10",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "笨蛋,那一隊早就被我們宰光了!那麼,你們的首領薩卡為何要攻打哈斯米爾?趕快說清楚!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "惡"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/f95eacdc314e/scenes/0/lines/11",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/f95eacdc314e/scenes/0/lines/11",
          "text": "..這..這..我也不太清楚,只記得首領吩咐隊長的時候有提到要殺光精靈族以及務必要搶到寶物,其它的我就沒聽清楚了.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 17,
              "speaker_name": "米亞斯多德"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/f95eacdc314e/scenes/0/lines/12",
          "speaker": "character/native-17",
          "text": "什麼寶物?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "惡"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/f95eacdc314e/scenes/0/lines/13",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/f95eacdc314e/scenes/0/lines/13",
          "text": "..哎,我怎麼可能知道..求你們饒了我吧,我保證不會回去向首領通風報信.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/f95eacdc314e/scenes/0/lines/14",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "好吧,再回答我們一個問題,我們就放你走。你們的首領薩卡現在在哪裡?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "惡"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/f95eacdc314e/scenes/0/lines/15",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/f95eacdc314e/scenes/0/lines/15",
          "text": "首領啊..他應該是率領另一隊到拉卡湖去攻打豹人族了,如果沒錯的話,他應該還在那一帶才對。..我知道的都告訴你們了,可以放我走了吧?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/f95eacdc314e/scenes/0/lines/16",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "好,你可以走了!快滾吧!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "惡"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/f95eacdc314e/scenes/0/lines/17",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/f95eacdc314e/scenes/0/lines/17",
          "text": "謝..謝謝!"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/f95eacdc314e/scenes/0"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "隊伍議論陰謀,決議支援豹人族"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/f95eacdc314e/scenes/1/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "索爾,你怎麼可以未經大家的同意就放他走呢!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/f95eacdc314e/scenes/1/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "不要緊,我們需要的都已經知道了,不過情況好像更加麻煩了.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 1,
              "speaker_name": "哈諾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/f95eacdc314e/scenes/1/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-1",
          "text": "獸人族是吃了什麼熊心豹子膽,竟敢同時攻打精靈族和豹人族!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/f95eacdc314e/scenes/1/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "我看啊,一定是有人在背後指使,不然獸人族那來這麼大的膽量。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 14,
              "speaker_name": "珊"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/f95eacdc314e/scenes/1/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-14",
          "text": "豹人族的戰鬥力在這大陸的幾個種族中雖然也是數一數二的,但這種規模的攻擊他們也未必擋得住,我們還是先去拉卡湖看看吧,必要時還可以支援他們。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/f95eacdc314e/scenes/1/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "拉卡湖離此地不遠,途中好像有個小村落,我們可以先在那裡休息一下。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/f95eacdc314e/scenes/1/lines/6",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "那我們還等什麼?走吧!"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/f95eacdc314e/scenes/1"
    }
